BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Canvass Fresno/Kerman CD22 | July 17\, 18\, 19
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260719T093000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260719T130000
UID:3fab4b2727c262d39c967fa84356403a@mobilize.us
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mobilize-uploads-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/u
 ploads/event/Mobilize%20CD22%20Villegas_20260629041428400161.png
DESCRIPTION:**It's time to talk to voters in CD22!** Let's build the grass
 roots power Democrats need to elect **Randy Villegas in 2026** and to defe
 nd democracy long term. Join us in going door-to-door talking to voters. W
 e'll employ **deep canvassing techniques** such as active listening to ope
 n our voter conversations and learn which issues are important to them. **
 $100 daily stipend** is available to offset the cost of gas and lodging. -
  Friday\, July 17 | 3:00 pm to 6:00 pm - Saturday\, July 18 | 9:30 am 
LOCATION:Volunteer travel to Fresno/Kerman!\, Piedmont\, CA\, 94611
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/cadems/event/980709/
X-SOURCE:Indivisible Sonoma County (Mobilize)
END:VEVENT
