 ploads/organization/89957_20260715180009713644.jpg
DESCRIPTION:On July 7\, Lorenzo Salgado Araujo was shot and killed by an I
 CE agent in Houston while driving a work van with his crew. On July 13\, I
 CE fatally shot 26-year-old Johan Sebastian Guerrero in Biddeford\, Maine 
 — his wife and toddler forced to witness his murder. Both men were belov
 ed members of their communities\, killed on their way to work. Join us for
  a vigil to demand Justice for Lorenzo. Justice for Johan. Justice for All
 . ICE Out. *A core principle behind all Disappeared In America events is a
LOCATION:Juilliard Park\, 227 Santa Rosa Ave\, Santa Rosa\, CA\, 95401
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/disappearedinamerica/event/992239/
X-SOURCE:Indivisible Sonoma County (Mobilize)
END:VEVENT
