 . --- We're focusing on the 2026 House and Senate races in Swing States an
 d Swing Districts to take back Congress in the Midterms. As\, of course\, 
 you know\, the House is in chaos. The Republican Party is not hiding the f
 act that they do not know how to govern\, and they are acting out in very 
 immature ways because this is the behavior of their MAGA leader. Cost: $14
  for a packet of 20 cards (cash only\, please) [Questions? Email Molly!](
