BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Indivisible Sonoma County Action Brainstorming / Activist Support 
 Group (Sebastopol)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260729T103000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260729T123000
UID:82425ee5f0947276e88403f5424076da@mobilize.us
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mobilize-uploads-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/u
 ploads/event/brainstorm%20pix_20240702180452249989.jpeg
DESCRIPTION:Come to one or all of these Indivisible Sonoma County meetings
  to gather with a community of progressive folks active in grassroots acti
 ons. This is a time for democracy and each of us has something to contribu
 te to this existential responsibility that rests on all of us. We will be 
 there and hope you will be too. In-person event (no Zoom). Doors open at 1
 0am.
LOCATION:Sebastopol\, CA
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/indivisiblesonomacounty/event/743380/
X-SOURCE:Indivisible Sonoma County (Mobilize)
END:VEVENT
