 ploads/event/IMG_4985_20260702190748994939.jpeg
DESCRIPTION:Explore strategies for conducting outreach that centers impact
 ed communities\, practices accountable allyship\, and strengthens relation
 ships across networks. Emphasize solidarity\, care\, and ethical engagemen
 t to support sustainable movement growth.
LOCATION:Virtual event
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/indivisible/event/958440/
X-SOURCE:Indivisible Sonoma County (Mobilize)
